        {
            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Element Name</td><td>Type</td><td>Semantics</td></tr><tr><td>Header</td><td>complexType: MessageHeaderType Refer to 8.3.3</td><td>Contains general information, used for all messages.</td></tr><tr><td>ResponseCode</td><td>simpleType: responseCodeType enumeration refer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>ResponseCode indicating the acknowledgment status of any of the V2G messages received by the SECC.</td></tr><tr><td>EVSEProcessing</td><td>simpleType: processingType enumeration refer to Annex A for the type definition</td><td>Parameter value &quot;Finished&quot; indicates that the EVSE has finished the processing that was initiated after CertificateInstallationReq. Parameter value &quot;Ongoing&quot; indicates that the EVSE is still processing at the time when the response message was sent.</td></tr><tr><td>CPSCertificateChain</td><td>complexType: CertificateChainType refer to 8.3.5.3.3</td><td>The transmitted certificate chain is used by the EVCC to verify the signature in the message header.</td></tr><tr><td>SignedInstallationData</td><td>complexType: SignedInstallationDataType refer to 8.3.5.3.39</td><td>Includes all data to extract contract certificate and private key of contract certificate</td></tr><tr><td>RemainingContractCertificateChains</td><td>simpleType: xs:unsignedByte</td><td>When larger than 0, additional contract certificate chains will be installed.</td></tr></table>",
